\"></i> Interaction, prototyping, design systems</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"mk-resume-header-actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\"><i data-lucide=\"layout-grid\"></i> See the work</a>\n      <a class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" href=\"#\">About me</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Compact","html":"<header class=\"mk-resume-header\" data-variant=\"compact\">\n  <img class=\"mk-resume-header-photo\" src=\"images/mk-portrait2.png\" alt=\"\" />\n  <div class=\"mk-resume-header-body\">\n    <p class=\"mk-resume-header-status\"\n      ><span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-variant=\"warning\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Booked until March</p\n    >\n    <h1 class=\"mk-resume-header-name\">Mara Okafor</h1>\n    <p class=\"mk-resume-header-role\">Design engineer</p>\n    <ul class=\"mk-resume-header-facts\">\n      <li><i data-lucide=\"map-pin\"></i> Berlin</li>\n      <li><i data-lucide=\"mail\"></i> <a href=\"mailto:mara@example.com\">mara@example.com</a></li>\n      <li><i data-lucide=\"phone\"></i> +49 30 1234 5678</li>\n      <li><i data-lucide=\"globe\"></i> <a href=\"#\">maraokafor.dev</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</header>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Poster","html":"<header class=\"mk-resume-header\" data-variant=\"poster\">\n  <img\n    class=\"mk-resume-header-photo corner-blob shadow-sticker\"\n    src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\"\n    alt=\"\"\n    data-df-entrance=\"pop\"\n    style=\"--df-motion-delay: 300ms\"\n  />\n  <div class=\"mk-resume-header-body\">\n    <p class=\"mk-resume-header-status\"\n      ><span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-variant=\"success\" data-animate=\"ping\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Open for\n      commissions</p\n    >\n    <h1 class=\"mk-resume-header-name\" data-df-entrance=\"up\">Jonas<br />Weber</h1>\n    <p class=\"mk-resume-header-role\">Type &amp; identity designer</p>\n    <div class=\"mk-resume-header-actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\"><i data-lucide=\"layout-grid\"></i> See the work</a>\n      <a class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" href=\"mailto:jonas@example.com\">jonas@example.com</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Split","html":"<header class=\"mk-resume-header\" data-variant=\"split\">\n  <img class=\"mk-resume-header-photo corner-arch\" src=\"images/mk-portrait2.png\" alt=\"\" data-df-entrance=\"wipe-up\" />\n  <div class=\"mk-resume-header-body\">\n    <h1 class=\"mk-resume-header-name\">Hello, I'm Lea.</h1>\n    <p class=\"mk-resume-header-role\">Illustrator and motion designer in Leipzig</p>\n    <p class=\"mk-resume-header-summary\"\n      >I draw for books, brands and the small screens in between - and make the drawings move when they want to.</p\n    >\n    <ul class=\"mk-resume-header-facts\">\n      <li><i data-lucide=\"sparkles\"></i> Clients in 14 countries</li>\n      <li><i data-lucide=\"award\"></i> ADC Gold 2025</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"mk-resume-header-actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Commission a piece</a>\n      <a class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" href=\"#\">Shop prints</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n","individual":true}]
